# `for (let at = 0; at < most; at = (at + 1) | 0) .. found = (found + 1) | 0;`: a head parameter that enters as one whole number was started at the end of the exact whole numbers; the walk fitted, what came round was an int32, and the loop was walked again for the narrower form.
